Spec: Generation-bound business connection meter

Purpose:
  Produce truthful cumulative connection snapshots throughout one non-migrating stream lifetime.

Owns:
  ./ConnectionMeter.java

References:
  /contracts/java/src/main/java/dev/linkgate/contracts/ConnectionStatus.sdd

Must:
  Track original admission, one selected path, actual payload counts, setup duration and terminal completeness separately.
  Derive timestamps from original UTC and monotonic elapsed time; clock rollback and counter overflow fail closed without wrapping counts.
  Increase snapshot sequence under the same lock as state changes and ignore late state or byte events after termination.
  Mark complete only after clean bidirectional FIN and drain; interrupted or recovered tails remain incomplete.
